[00:01.08]1. Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.40]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:07.96]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:11.68]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:15.02]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:19.08]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:22.74]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:26.16]Letting all his victims go.
[00:31.52](Chorus)
[00:31.62]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:36.26]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:45.12]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:52.36]As the apple of my eye.
[00:58.06]2. Even though your foes are many,
[00:58.80]Though they threaten and revile,
[00:58.82]Though they flatter and they smile,
[00:58.82]To mislead and to beguile.
[01:17.90]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[01:21.34]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:24.90]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:28.32]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:33.20](Chorus)
[01:34.04]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:38.09]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:46.92]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:52.36]As the apple of my eye.
[02:00.42]3. Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:04.36]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:08.06]Though you die upon the field,
[02:11.96]Even death to me will yield.
[02:15.88]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.08]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:22.60]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.36]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:30.72](Chorus)
[02:31.66]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:37.78]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:45.46]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:50.18]As the apple of my eye.
